  "steps": [
    "Season. Mix the chicken with smoked paprika, peri seasoning, peri marinade, salt and pepper until evenly coated.",
    "Air fry. Cook at 190 °C for 12–14 minutes, depending on thickness, until cooked through and lightly charred. Add the cheese for the final 1–2 minutes.",
    "Chop. Cut the chicken into bite-sized pieces.",
    "Fill. Lay lettuce down the centre of each wrap, top with chicken, then drizzle with perinaise and chilli jam.",
    "Roll. Fold in the sides, roll up tightly, slice in half and serve immediately."
